# Baseline for bare internal hash citations lacking ("subject") annotation.
# The gate reports ADVISORY for entries listed here; any new bare citation
# not present in this file is a FAIL.  This is a descend-only ratchet:
# removing a bare citation removes its entry; adding one fails immediately.
